      178.29,
      204.29,
      385.4,
      229.79
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE VEEMANSAA DHAMMAGUPTHAFOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      246.65,
      401.89,
      328.43
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cVeemansaa Dhammaguptha Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Trust according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      345.29,
      401.9,
      413.03
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      429.89,
      401.91,
      455.39
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      472.25,
      401.89,
      511.79
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the VeemansaaDhammaguptha Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      528.65,
      401.91,
      666.83
    ],
    "text": "2. (1) From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the VeemansaaDhammaguptha Foundation (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession, under the name and style of the\u201cVeemansaa Dhammaguptha Foundation\u201d (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cbody corporate\u201d) and by that name may sueand be sued, in all courts with full power and authority to haveand use a common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      408.81,
