      204.29,
      397.2,
      285.59
    ],
    "text": "(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      302.33,
      397.19,
      327.59
    ],
    "text": "3. (1) The general objects for which the body corporate isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      344.33,
      397.2,
      425.63
    ],
    "text": "(a) to formulate a course of action to uphold the historicvalue of the Upcountry Amarapura Sect and appreciatethe services to the Buddhist religious order (Sasana)by the priests who had been resident at the SriSudharmarama Raja Maha Vihara in Batagalla fromits inception and giving priority to it; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      442.25,
      397.18,
      467.63
    ],
    "text": "(b) to use the strategies necessary in directing Buddhistpeople towards the three-fold meritorious deeds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      484.25,
      397.2,
      565.67
    ],
    "text": "(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1), the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste,gender, political opinion, place of birth or any of suchgrounds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      582.29,
      397.19,
      649.67
    ],
    "text": "4.The objects of the body corporate shall be carriedout in such manner so as not to create any conflict betweenthe work of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or any Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
