    ],
    "text": "12. All debts and liabilities of the Foundation existingon the day preceding the date of commencement of this Act,shall be paid by the body corporate hereby constituted andall debts due to and subscriptions and contributions payableto the Foundation on that day shall be paid to the bodycorporate for the purpose of this Act.",
